{title: Ye Daulat Bhi Le Lo}
{artist: Jagjit Singh}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]ye daulat bhii le lo,
[C]ye shoharat [Am]bhii le lo
[Dm]bhale [C]chhin lo [G]muzse [Am]meri javani
[Am]magar mujhako lautaa do
[F]bachapan [Am]kaa saavan
[Am]vo kaagaz [E]ki kashti vo [Am]barish ka pani
[Am]muhalle [E]ki sabase [Am]purani nishani
[Am]vo budhiya [E]jise bachche [Am]kehte the naani
[E]vo naani ki baato [Am]me pariyo ka dera
[B]vo chahare [G]kii jhuriryo me
[E]sadiyon [Am]kaa pheraa
[Am]bhulae nahi [G]bhul sakta [F]hai koi
[E]vo chhoti si [Am]raate vo lambi kahani
[Am]kadi dhup [E]me apane [Am]ghar se nikalna
[Am]vo chidiya [E]vo bulbul [Am]vo titli pakadna
[E]vo gudiya ki [Am]shadi me ladna jhagadna
[B]vo jhuulon [G]se giranaa
[E]vo gir [Am]ke sambhalanaa
[Am]vo pital [G]ke chhallo ke [F]pyare se tohfe
[E]vo tuuti hui [Am]chudiyo kii nishani
[Am]kabhii ret [E]ke unche [Am]tiilon pe jaanaa
[Am]gharaunde [E]banana [Am]banake mitana
[E]vo masum chahat [Am]ki tasvir apani
[B]vo khaabo [G]khilauno kii
[E]jaagir [Am]apani
[Am]na duniya ka [G]gam tha na [F]rishto ke bandhan
[E]badi khubsurat [Am]thi vo zindgani
